    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ANNIHILATE</strong> a small army's worth of ghouls, knaves and miners, with the power of lasers, missiles and kidneys!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UPGRADE</strong> your power infinitely: Every upgrade you can find, can be stacked <strong>as many times as you please</strong>, allowing you to claim some sort of <strong>level 45 Laser Beam That Covers The Whole Screen</strong>, if you have the luck for it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SELECT</strong> from a handful of different characters, each with their own playstyles! The aggressive <strong>OLIVE</strong> shall run headlong into hordes of enemies to claim <strong>blessed orbs</strong>, while the industrious <strong>GLORIA</strong> shall construct an <strong>impenetrable fortress</strong> that grinds any adversaries to dust! And Jerry is there too, he doesn't do anything special though.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/167e825906ecede95c5c257d4e76d1be.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ANNIHILATE</strong> a small army's worth of ghouls, knaves and miners, with the power of lasers, missiles and kidneys!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/f4e24f41a6ca0147891e6d044e21b16b.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UPGRADE</strong> your power infinitely: Every upgrade you can find, can be stacked <strong>as many times as you please</strong>, allowing you to claim some sort of <strong>level 45 Laser Beam That Covers The Whole Screen</strong>, if you have the luck for it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.poster.avif?t=1682660137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.webm?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379880/extras/84f3dab035992c9aae9c852925e5597c.mp4?t=1682660137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SELECT</strong> from a handful of different characters, each with their own playstyles! The aggressive <strong>OLIVE</strong> shall run headlong into hordes of enemies to claim <strong>blessed orbs</strong>, while the industrious <strong>GLORIA</strong> shall construct an <strong>impenetrable fortress</strong> that grinds any adversaries to dust! And Jerry is there too, he doesn't do anything special though.",
    "short_description": "ANNIHILATE a small army's worth of ghouls, knaves and miners, with the power of lasers, missiles and kidneys! You're alone against these hordes with nothing but INCREDIBLE WEAPONRY and MURDEROUS INTENT. Can you survive for FOUR MINUTES?",
